%stringarray ck_str_levelEntryText
"Keen races around\nThe Suburbs",
"Keen awakens to his\nBedroom",
"Keen wades through\nThe Sewer System",
"Keen pigs out at\nScudder's",
"Keen reaches the\nCheckpoint",
"Keen darts through\nthe Deserted Block",
"Keen slinks into The\nUnoccupied House",
"Keen reaches the\nCheckpoint",
"Keen calls into The\nCasey's Place",
"Keen reaches the\nCheckpoint",
"Keen takes a break\nin the Backyard\nClubhouse",
"Keen barges into the\nGolden House",
"Keen jumps the fence\nto the Bleach\nColored House",
"Keen clambers onto\nthe Bus roof to find\nMortimer",
"Keen intrudes in on\nThe Mansion",
"The Player cheats\ntheir way into the\nHigh Scores",
"Keen ends up at the\nNeighbor's Backyard",
"Keen reaches the\nCheckpoint",
"Keen arrives at the\nNeighbor's Front\nYard",
"Keen reaches the\nCheckpoint",
"Keen tramples over\nthe Cosy Dwelling",
"Keen reaches the\nCheckpoint",
"Keen trespasses into\nMr Jenkins Yard",
"Keen reaches the\nCheckpoint"

%string ck_str_storyText "Commander Keen in...\nSuburb Shenanigans\n\nBilly Blaze's home life\nwas like any other\neight-year old kid's\nliving in the suburbs.\nSchool was a chore and\nkids gave him a hard\ntime about his\noutstanding intellect.\n\nThe only time Billy\ncould escape it all was\nwhen he became\nCommander Keen,\ndefender of Earth!\nBilly had had many\nadventures in space.\nHe'd saved the Earth,\nhe'd saved the Galaxy,\nand recently he'd saved\nthe Universe!\n\nThe two lives\ncontrasted each other\nnicely.\n\nToday isn't just\nanother school day \nthough, it's the\nday of the school's\nannual IQ test, and\nto top it off,\nBilly's lost his bag\nand missed the bus..."

